<title>HONG KONG: Onfem Holdings suspended - HK exchange.</title>
<headline>Onfem Holdings suspended - HK exchange.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of property investment company Onfem Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Onfem shares rose HK$0.25 to end at HK$3.65 on Friday.</p>
<p>Onfem is an investment holding company with subsidiaries engaging in property investment and development, trading and industrial investment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
